    "Use specific corrective feedback steps (praise, identify precise error, give an immediate one-step fix) and rehearse a short script to make this routine.",
    "Plan 2–3 differentiated task cards (support / practice / challenge) to provide targeted practice and extension within the same lesson.",
    "Always include one explicit follow-up to a student's answer that references their exact wording (e.g. 'آپ نے کہا X — کیا مطلب یہ ہے کہ Y?') to make on-the-spot assessment formative.",
    "Implement deliberate wait-time (3–5 seconds) after student answers and invite a peer paraphrase; this aligns with the teacher's stated intention to give quieter students more time."
  ],
  "notable_moments": [
    {
      "what_happened": "استاد نے circle کے ماڈل پر بات چیت شروع کی۔ پوری کلاس نے اکٹھے 'یس' کہہ کر جواب دیا جب استاد نے تصدیق کی کہ 'یہ ایک ماڈل ہے، ٹھیک ہے؟' اور 'یہ ایک پورا ہول ہے نا؟'",
      "approx_time_phrase": "شروع میں، قریب ایک منٹ کے بعد",
      "significance_reason_en": "The class is in unison and compliant, but this chorus of 'yes' may mask individual confusion. It sets a pattern of the teacher seeking confirmation rather than deep understanding."
    },
